   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "M1: the driver in one process.   M7: Generator / Learner / Reference / Reward as Ray actors.\n--entry check: nanorft.cluster_check, one actor per GPU, NCCL all-reduce bus bandwidth.\nBetween nodes NCCL must log NET/IB (RDMA), not NET/Socket.",
   "originalText": "M1: the driver in one process.   M7: Generator / Learner / Reference / Reward as Ray actors.\n--entry check: nanorft.cluster_check, one actor per GPU, NCCL all-reduce bus bandwidth.\nBetween nodes NCCL must log NET/IB (RDMA), not NET/Socket.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
